    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/9101e0216f2d32edea8913178edc8419.avif?t=1753775921\" data-has-big width=800 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the roots of legend comes <i>Secrets of the Burrow</i>!</strong> A whimsical 3D adventure bursting with charm, chaos, and a touch of woodland mischief!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the spirited Princess Vixoria and her begrudging companion, Sir Foxalot, on a quest through an enchanted forest, and ancient ruins teeming with mystery. Swap between heroes, bash pesky Gnomes, and gather rare magical ingredients for a potion that just might save the day, or make things worse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Secrets of the Burrow</i> delivers a family-friendly escapade with big heart and bigger laughs. Perfect for fans of classic platformers looking for a new spin on the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/1e4181fe7ded0cd8f8e79fe350ca7dfa.avif?t=1753775921\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/3847515a5e43d9a781708ce3eed2ebbc.avif?t=1753775921\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a visually enchanting, fully interconnected world. From a waterfall filled basin to windswept canyons, every corner of the forest teems with mysteries waiting to be uncovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/f7873acfab95fd3ec336ecc4683457f8.avif?t=1753775921\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/1fc7aff300a5b37c48af05d87070bac9.poster.avif?t=1753775921\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/1fc7aff300a5b37c48af05d87070bac9.webm?t=1753775921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/1fc7aff300a5b37c48af05d87070bac9.mp4?t=1753775921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in <strong>Secrets of the Burrow</strong> revolves around the innovative RPM system, where maintaining momentum is everything. As Sir Foxalot, players unleash a relentless spinning attack reminiscent of a whirlwind. Your goal is to build up and sustain high RPM while skillfully avoiding obstacles and enemy attacks. Colliding with anything will cause you to lose momentum, so precise movement and awareness are key. This simple yet engaging system delivers a unique and fast-paced combat experience that rewards mastery through a scoring system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/e28895540a9b3ce6a36c27534d051197.avif?t=1753775921\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/9c898ed90dbecc3bdfeb10fb76e97053.poster.avif?t=1753775921\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/9c898ed90dbecc3bdfeb10fb76e97053.webm?t=1753775921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/9c898ed90dbecc3bdfeb10fb76e97053.mp4?t=1753775921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey through the forest is rich with discovery, blending vibrant platforming sequences with brain-teasing puzzles. Unlock new abilities, tackle hidden challenges, and return to the central hub\u2014a warm campfire scene where Sir Foxalot and Vixoria share heartfelt conversations, deepening their relationship and the player\u2019s emotional connection to their journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>So Fluff your tail, and burrow into an adventure full of surprises, heart, and swordplay! </strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/9101e0216f2d32edea8913178edc8419.avif?t=1753775921\" data-has-big width=800 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the roots of legend comes <i>Secrets of the Burrow</i>!</strong> A whimsical 3D adventure bursting with charm, chaos, and a touch of woodland mischief!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the spirited Princess Vixoria and her begrudging companion, Sir Foxalot, on a quest through an enchanted forest, and ancient ruins teeming with mystery. Swap between heroes, bash pesky Gnomes, and gather rare magical ingredients for a potion that just might save the day, or make things worse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Secrets of the Burrow</i> delivers a family-friendly escapade with big heart and bigger laughs. Perfect for fans of classic platformers looking for a new spin on the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/1e4181fe7ded0cd8f8e79fe350ca7dfa.avif?t=1753775921\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/3847515a5e43d9a781708ce3eed2ebbc.avif?t=1753775921\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a visually enchanting, fully interconnected world. From a waterfall filled basin to windswept canyons, every corner of the forest teems with mysteries waiting to be uncovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/f7873acfab95fd3ec336ecc4683457f8.avif?t=1753775921\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/1fc7aff300a5b37c48af05d87070bac9.poster.avif?t=1753775921\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/1fc7aff300a5b37c48af05d87070bac9.webm?t=1753775921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/1fc7aff300a5b37c48af05d87070bac9.mp4?t=1753775921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in <strong>Secrets of the Burrow</strong> revolves around the innovative RPM system, where maintaining momentum is everything. As Sir Foxalot, players unleash a relentless spinning attack reminiscent of a whirlwind. Your goal is to build up and sustain high RPM while skillfully avoiding obstacles and enemy attacks. Colliding with anything will cause you to lose momentum, so precise movement and awareness are key. This simple yet engaging system delivers a unique and fast-paced combat experience that rewards mastery through a scoring system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/e28895540a9b3ce6a36c27534d051197.avif?t=1753775921\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/9c898ed90dbecc3bdfeb10fb76e97053.poster.avif?t=1753775921\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/9c898ed90dbecc3bdfeb10fb76e97053.webm?t=1753775921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729660/extras/9c898ed90dbecc3bdfeb10fb76e97053.mp4?t=1753775921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey through the forest is rich with discovery, blending vibrant platforming sequences with brain-teasing puzzles. Unlock new abilities, tackle hidden challenges, and return to the central hub\u2014a warm campfire scene where Sir Foxalot and Vixoria share heartfelt conversations, deepening their relationship and the player\u2019s emotional connection to their journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>So Fluff your tail, and burrow into an adventure full of surprises, heart, and swordplay! </strong></p>",
